<title>USA: NYSE unavailable - Corimon SACA.</title>
<headline>NYSE unavailable - Corimon SACA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Corimon SACA would not resume trading today.</p>
<p>No further details were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
